// Ch2 B02 "Neme's table" (docs/kb/story/beats/vertical_slice.md): Rhen wakes at noon in Asha's aunt
// Neme's house, to far too much food. Neme talks to him the way she'd talk to a stray she has decided
// to keep. Her fear shows only in how much food there is, and she never mentions Asha's packed bag
// (M2-FP-14: one camera insert on it, B02_bag, after her last line). In-engine (no letterbox), staged at her door
// by the Village spawn, on the first arrival after the tideline battle is won (dawn on the walk up,
// then noon at Neme's); the scene opens black for the time jump.
title: ch02_nemes_table
location: ch02/haluna
---
@fade in 1.0
Neme [neutral]: Up, then. Sit. Not that stool, it bites. #line:ch02_nemes_table_001
Neme [soft_smile]: Fish, then bread, then more fish. The sea gave you back thin. #line:ch02_nemes_table_002
Rhen [neutral]: That's a lot of food for one stranger. #line:ch02_nemes_table_003
Neme [neutral]: It's the right amount. Eat. Asha's at the market. She'll want to show you everything today. #line:ch02_nemes_table_004
@camera B02_bag blend=0.0
@wait 1.6
@camera release
<<set $ch02_ate_at_nemes = true>>
===
